ore, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}\\,\\text{d}s=22.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=11 \\pi+22=11(\\pi+2).\n$$" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564718 1080 "31" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564718 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564718 1083 #uuid "e7adcb95-bcf9-5d59-b9d2-6219b2002b48" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564719 1080 "6 \\pi" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564719 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564719 1083 #uuid "e7d5c7cb-3b29-56e2-b316-e056114bfe86" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564720 1080 "44" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564720 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564720 1083 #uuid "eda40aa1-5495-5e53-b669-a9ec57816c2f" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564721 1080 "\\frac{22}{3}" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564721 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564721 1083 #uuid "f63dbde9-05aa-5d77-8273-3853668871e5" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564722 1080 "\\frac{13 \\sqrt{2}}{3} + \\frac{13 \\pi}{6}" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564722 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564722 1083 #uuid "fa4567d7-c42b-5422-bf04-872ca010ce42" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564723 1080 "\\sqrt{37} + 20" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564723 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564723 1083 #uuid "fada5617-6d0a-523e-aacd-a9ac36a57c08" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564724 1068 #edb/ref 17592186564682 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564724 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564724 1071 "![](images/24/249efb9fbaa6cc4f1bd923dd5aaa93d149cc07c56e23eb8ba12870b16c9108d3.png)\n\nCalculate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the path shown above." 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564724 1072 #uuid "fbcb1b60-1072-56e6-92d0-39f4e15df49b" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564724 1074 "The path $C$ is made up of three parts, as shown below:\n\n![](images/20/20f9c299762ace89c0d0f8db158d6c8cedf266c5a08ad580c314a7d964897596.png)\n\nNow, we make use of the following facts:\n\n- If $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}\\cup {C}_{3}$ is a piecewise-smooth curve, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s+{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\n- The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=L.\n$$\n\nThe paths ${C}_{1}$ and ${C}_{3}$ are line segments of length $6.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{{C}_{3}}\\,\\text{d}s=6.\n$$\n\nThe path ${C}_{2}$ is the hypotenuse of a right triangle whose legs have lengths $6$ and $\\frac{5}{2}.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}\\,\\text{d}s=\\sqrt{{6}^{2}+{\\frac{5}{2}}^{2}}=\\frac{13}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=6+\\frac{13}{2}+6=\\frac{37}{2}.\n$$" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564725 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186162082.py" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true] [17592186564725 1169 #uuid "1076aa62-db52-58ca-8dd8-de3aa73fab5b" 13194139536074 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"05cb0d74-f33b-5fbe-8029-cbdbf413f5a0" 17592186564655 "0a4026ea-c30a-5983-ad0c-bd822a8dc3e7" 17592186564656 "0b2c3990-098b-5ab0-9aba-fc2d02824443" 17592186564657 "1400ed01-a0a6-55a6-a62b-81de67ec5459" 17592186564658 "1b3cc87c-7837-5272-af3c-85f049ceebe3" 17592186564659 "1e1298ec-a4c1-5df3-be99-ba930b16d915" 17592186564660 "1e1dfdee-ccb2-5113-b159-0eb59c429284" 17592186564661 "254fa1aa-2b59-5f26-9246-2796d0242d88" 17592186564662 "26afed18-8d28-5c6b-87a4-7b956d517b25" 175921865646